{"surface": "inspector", "title": "Forecast: Bitcoin falls below $50,000 by May 18, 2027", "html": "<header class=\"hero\"><p class=\"kicker\">Forecast</p><div class=\"fig\">51.5%</div><p class=\"ctx\"><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:7\">Bitcoin falls below $50,000 by May 18, 2027</a></p></header><div class=\"fc-bridge pscale\"><div class=\"fcb-ends\"><div class=\"fcb-end\"><span>Lower bound</span><strong>26.0%</strong></div><div class=\"fcb-mid\"><span>Forecast</span><strong>51.5%</strong></div><div class=\"fcb-end r\"></div></div><div class=\"ps-track\"><i class=\"ps-band\" style=\"left:26.00%;width:calc(100.00% - 26.00%)\"></i><i class=\"ps-dot\" style=\"left:51.49%\"></i></div><div class=\"ps-ticks\"><span>0%</span><span>100%</span></div><div class=\"fcb-sub\"><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"x:interval:prop:7\">Market range</a></div></div><table class=\"fc-table fc-cases\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"cp-cond\"><span class=\"cp-role\">Condition</span><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"prop:22\">Bitcoin falls below $50,000 <span class=\"cp-date\">by December 31, 2026</span></a></th><th class=\"r\">Probability</th><th class=\"r\">Chance</th><th class=\"r\">Contribution</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">If Yes<span class=\"cp-sub\">Included by definition</span></th><td class=\"fc-math n\">26.5%</td><td class=\"fc-math n\">100.0%</td><td class=\"fc-val n\"><span class=\"n v\">26.5%</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">If No<span class=\"cp-sub\">Analyst input</span></th><td class=\"fc-math n\">73.5%</td><td class=\"fc-math n\">34.0%</td><td class=\"fc-val n\"><span class=\"n v\">+25.0%</span></td></tr><tr class=\"tot\"><th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"1\">Forecast</th><td></td><td></td><td class=\"fc-val n\"><span class=\"n v\">51.5%</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"sub\">Rationale · If No</h3><div class=\"basis note\"><div class=\"fold\"><div class=\"fold-in\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"The year-end markets (Kalshi 0.265, Polymarket 0.22) price a 2